<ontology/use_paper_making/use_paper_making__0529__q1/#resource> dcterms:bibliographicCitation "Watt (1908), Commercial Products of India, scan p. 877" ;
    dcterms:source <https://archive.org/details/b31361584/page/n877/mode/1up> ;
    a <ontology/EvidenceQuote/#resource> ;
    rdfs:label "Evidence for Jute used in Paper Making & Cardboard: Watt (1908), Commercial Products of India, scan p. 877"@en ;
    <ontology/quoteText/#resource> "No fibre known to commerce can compete with jute in point of cheapness, yet the paper-makers can afford to purchase jute waste and jute cuttings only, so that but for the demand for an altogether different purpose the paper-maker could never procure jute at all."@en ;
    <ontology/retrievalMode/#resource> "direct_sentence" .
